     "@es": "**Non so dove sia** (no sé dónde está), **Vorrei sapere quanto costi** (quisiera saber cuánto cuesta), **Mi chiedo chi fosse** (me pregunto quién era).",
     "@en": "**Non so dove sia** (I don't know where he is), **Vorrei sapere quanto costi** (I'd like to know how much he costs), **Mi chiedo chi fosse** (I wonder who he was)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "El modo depende del contexto: no toda interrogativa indirecta exige congiuntivo.",
     "@en": "The mode depends on the context: not every indirect question requires congiuntive."
    }
   ]
