  "@es": "Una pregunta indirecta se integra en una frase: **Non so dove sia la stazione**. En italiano cuidado el congiuntivo es frecuente cuando hay duda; en varias interrogativas indirectas también se usa el indicativo, según el verbo y el registro.",
  "@en": "An indirect question is integrated into a sentence: **Non so dove sia la stazione**. In Italian care the congiuntive is common when there is doubt; in several indirect interrogations the indication is also used, according to the verb and the record."
